@	
s	init	Create a new, empty CDK project from a template
s	metadata	Returns all metadata associated with this stack
s	doctor	Check your set-up for potential problems
s	diff	Compares the specified stack with the deployed stack
s	destroy	Destroy the specified stack(s)
s	deploy	Deploy the specified stack(s) into your AWS account
s	bootstrap	Deploys the CDK toolkit stack into an AWS environment
s	synth|synthesize	Synthesizes and prints the CloudFormation template for this stack
s	ls|list	List all stacks in the app
s	import	Import existing resource(s) into the given STACK
s	watch	Shortcut for 'deploy --watch'
s	ack|acknowledge	Acknowledge a notice so that it does not show up anymore
s	notices	Returns a list of relevant notices
s	context	Manage cached context values
s	doc|docs	Opens the reference documentation in a browser
o	--version	The current version	
o	-h|--help	Show help	
@	init
@	metadata
@	doctor
@	diff
@	destroy
@	deploy
@	bootstrap
@	synth
@	ls
@	import
@	watch
@	ack
@	notices
@	context
@	doc
